# Vellum symbol library: DISCRETE components.
# Format (see Vellum): quarter-grid units, pins on whole units (mult. of 4).
#   symbol CODE PFX / s x0 y0 x1 y1 / c cx cy r / t x y C / p x y / end
symbol R R
s 0 0 4 0
s 4 0 5 -3
s 5 -3 7 3
s 7 3 9 -3
s 9 -3 11 3
s 11 3 12 0
s 12 0 16 0
p 0 0
p 16 0
end
symbol C C
s 0 0 3 0
s 3 -4 3 4
s 5 -4 5 4
s 5 0 8 0
p 0 0
p 8 0
end
symbol CP C
s 0 0 3 0
s 3 -4 3 4
s 0 -6 2 -6
s 1 -7 1 -5
s 6 -4 5 -1
s 5 -1 5 1
s 5 1 6 4
s 5 0 8 0
p 0 0
p 8 0
end
