symbol NPN Q
s 0 0 4 0
s 4 -4 4 4
c 6 0 6
s 4 -2 8 -6
s 8 -6 8 -8
s 4 2 8 6
s 8 6 8 8
s 8 6 5 5
s 8 6 7 3
