symbol SW S
s 0 0 3 0
c 4 0 1
c 12 0 1
s 5 0 11 -4
s 13 0 16 0
p 0 0
p 16 0
end
symbol FUSE F
s 0 0 2 0
s 2 -2 10 -2
s 10 -2 10 2
s 10 2 2 2
s 2 2 2 -2
s 2 0 10 0
s 10 0 12 0
p 0 0
p 12 0
end
symbol BAT B
s 0 0 3 0
s 3 -4 3 4
s 5 -2 5 2
s 5 0 8 0
